1
00:00:01,130 --> 00:00:02,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>BEYOND JOURNEY'S END</b></font>

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

3
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:32,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>EPISODE 31:
SOMEWHERE SHE'D LIKE</b></font>

4
00:01:32,890 --> 00:01:34,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>29 YEARS AFTER THE DEATH
OF HIMMEL THE HERO,</b></font>

5
00:01:34,930 --> 00:01:36,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>IN THE ETWAS MOUNTAINS,
LOCATED IN THE NORTHERN LANDS</b></font>

6
00:01:36,850 --> 00:01:37,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

7
00:01:38,020 --> 00:01:40,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[birds chirping]</b></font>

8
00:01:41,390 --> 00:01:42,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunts softly]</b></font>

9
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:46,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't expect it to get
so warm and sunny</b></font>

10
00:01:46,860 --> 00:01:47,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>this far north.</b></font>

11
00:01:47,820 --> 00:01:49,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We are in a volcanic area.</b></font>

12
00:01:49,860 --> 00:01:53,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This region is known
for its unusual warmth.</b></font>

13
00:01:53,070 --> 00:01:56,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That means we're getting close
to the hot springs, right?</b></font>

14
00:01:56,830 --> 00:01:58,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Indeed.</b></font>

15
00:01:58,330 --> 00:02:01,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I imagine the next town
will have a fine place to soak.</b></font>

16
00:02:01,330 --> 00:02:03,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I look forward to taking a dip.</b></font>

17
00:02:07,290 --> 00:02:08,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

18
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:12,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[footsteps]
-[rustling]</b></font>

19
00:02:18,310 --> 00:02:20,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hey, Frieren,</b></font>

20
00:02:20,060 --> 00:02:22,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we've been walking for a while.</b></font>

21
00:02:22,270 --> 00:02:24,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We at least getting close?</b></font>

22
00:02:24,850 --> 00:02:26,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Hmm...</b></font>

23
00:02:26,610 --> 00:02:29,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We should be coming upon
the village any second now.</b></font>

24
00:02:30,650 --> 00:02:32,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[bird cawing]</b></font>

25
00:02:33,700 --> 00:02:35,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Look, there's a cabin.</b></font>

26
00:02:37,200 --> 00:02:38,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] A solitary dwelling.</b></font>

27
00:02:38,950 --> 00:02:41,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have a bad feeling about this.</b></font>

28
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:44,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[children laughing]</b></font>

29
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:47,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[BOY 1] Don't be
a slow poke, mister!</b></font>

30
00:02:47,290 --> 00:02:48,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[BOY 2] Hurry up! Hurry up!</b></font>

31
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:51,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[laughter]
-[STARK] Wait for me!</b></font>

32
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:54,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This brings back old memories.</b></font>

33
00:02:54,420 --> 00:02:57,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The village you're looking for
was abandoned.</b></font>

34
00:02:57,260 --> 00:02:59,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's been crumbling
for over 30 years.</b></font>

35
00:03:00,180 --> 00:03:01,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When the hot spring dried,</b></font>

36
00:03:01,850 --> 00:03:05,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the adventurers with big purses
stopped passing through.</b></font>

37
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:08,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So close, Mistress,
yet so far.</b></font>

38
00:03:12,070 --> 00:03:14,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The moment you think
you know a human settlement,</b></font>

39
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:16,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it always gets
wiped clean off the map.</b></font>

40
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:18,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Suppose our dreams
will have to wait</b></font>

41
00:03:18,410 --> 00:03:20,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-until we reach the next town.
-[STARK] Gotcha.</b></font>

42
00:03:21,330 --> 00:03:23,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, how long you think
it's gonna take us to get there?</b></font>

43
00:03:23,910 --> 00:03:26,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A week's journey
at the very least.</b></font>

44
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:29,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But that's going to feel
like an eternity.</b></font>

45
00:03:30,630 --> 00:03:34,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There must be another hot spring
hiding somewhere out here.</b></font>

46
00:03:35,170 --> 00:03:36,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Hmm.</b></font>

47
00:03:36,550 --> 00:03:37,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN] Come to think of it,</b></font>

48
00:03:38,470 --> 00:03:41,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>my grandfather
used to tell a tall tale</b></font>

49
00:03:41,180 --> 00:03:42,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of a hidden hot spring</b></font>

50
00:03:42,390 --> 00:03:45,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>tucked deep within
the nearby mountains.</b></font>

51
00:03:46,430 --> 00:03:50,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though, that would've been
well over thirty years ago.</b></font>

52
00:03:52,150 --> 00:03:54,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The hidden spring
of the Etwas Mountains.</b></font>

53
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hm.</b></font>

54
00:03:55,320 --> 00:03:57,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So you've heard of it before?</b></font>

55
00:03:57,740 --> 00:04:00,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes, but I'm doubtful
it still exists.</b></font>

56
00:04:00,410 --> 00:04:02,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And it would be tricky
to find out.</b></font>

57
00:04:02,660 --> 00:04:05,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If our goal is to reach
a hot spring quickly,</b></font>

58
00:04:05,450 --> 00:04:08,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we would be better off
heading to the next village.</b></font>

59
00:04:08,540 --> 00:04:09,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Uh...</b></font>

60
00:04:09,830 --> 00:04:12,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's that face, Mr. Stark?</b></font>

61
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:15,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The hidden spring
of the Etwas Mountains.</b></font>

62
00:04:15,380 --> 00:04:18,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For some reason, I'm certain
I've heard that name before.</b></font>

63
00:04:19,470 --> 00:04:20,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh.</b></font>

64
00:04:20,510 --> 00:04:21,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I remember now.</b></font>

65
00:04:22,180 --> 00:04:25,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Frieren, I think I'd like to
make the trip,</b></font>

66
00:04:25,310 --> 00:04:26,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if that's all right with you.</b></font>

67
00:04:26,980 --> 00:04:28,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you sure?</b></font>

68
00:04:28,770 --> 00:04:30,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Allow me to warn you, Stark.</b></font>

69
00:04:30,690 --> 00:04:32,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's a hot spring
in the technical sense,</b></font>

70
00:04:32,860 --> 00:04:35,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I can assure you
it's not worth the trouble.</b></font>

71
00:04:35,150 --> 00:04:36,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>After all--</b></font>

72
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:38,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're already
in the middle of nowhere.</b></font>

73
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:39,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's go check it out.</b></font>

74
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:43,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark chuckles softly]</b></font>

75
00:04:45,580 --> 00:04:47,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Goodness, Stark.</b></font>

76
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:50,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If your heart is set on it,
I suppose mine can follow.</b></font>

77
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[BOY 1] Bye-bye, mister!</b></font>

78
00:04:52,670 --> 00:04:54,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good luck out there!</b></font>

79
00:04:54,090 --> 00:04:56,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[BOY 2] Come back
and play anytime!</b></font>

80
00:04:56,630 --> 00:04:58,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] You two be good!</b></font>

81
00:04:58,590 --> 00:05:00,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

82
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:47,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A legendary spring is near.</b></font>

83
00:05:53,770 --> 00:05:55,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mistress Frieren?</b></font>

84
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:58,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I really figured you'd be
more excited right now.</b></font>

85
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Alas...</b></font>

86
00:05:59,820 --> 00:06:02,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wandered this same wood
with the others.</b></font>

87
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:04,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My joy was even more
tempered back then.</b></font>

88
00:06:05,490 --> 00:06:06,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HEITER] Mmm.</b></font>

89
00:06:07,410 --> 00:06:09,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We should turn back.</b></font>

90
00:06:09,330 --> 00:06:10,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN] Agreed.</b></font>

91
00:06:11,370 --> 00:06:12,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You came here before?</b></font>

92
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:15,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And Mr. Himmel led
the charge? Why?</b></font>

93
00:06:15,750 --> 00:06:18,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Himmel was equally curious
and thorough.</b></font>

94
00:06:18,380 --> 00:06:21,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He wasn't satisfied
until he felt he'd explored</b></font>

95
00:06:21,090 --> 00:06:23,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>every nook and cranny
of a place.</b></font>

96
00:06:23,340 --> 00:06:26,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You promised short and quick,
yet gave us long and grueling!</b></font>

97
00:06:26,890 --> 00:06:28,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Heiter grunts]
-I'm telling you,</b></font>

98
00:06:28,060 --> 00:06:29,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there's something here,
Heiter.</b></font>

99
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:33,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I could feel it in my soul!
Just trust me.</b></font>

100
00:06:33,430 --> 00:06:35,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They should've listened to us.</b></font>

101
00:06:35,310 --> 00:06:37,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN] There's no
turning back now.</b></font>

102
00:06:37,610 --> 00:06:38,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

103
00:06:38,860 --> 00:06:40,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] The road
to the hidden spring</b></font>

104
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:42,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>grows increasingly brutal.</b></font>

105
00:06:45,610 --> 00:06:48,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At some point, you have to
pass through the territory</b></font>

106
00:06:48,330 --> 00:06:50,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of a troublesome monster.</b></font>

107
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:57,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

108
00:06:58,790 --> 00:07:01,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[distant roaring]</b></font>

109
00:07:03,050 --> 00:07:05,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seems "some point" is now.</b></font>

110
00:07:05,130 --> 00:07:06,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Get ready.</b></font>

111
00:07:09,050 --> 00:07:10,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunting]</b></font>

112
00:07:16,060 --> 00:07:18,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[monster roars]</b></font>

113
00:07:18,730 --> 00:07:19,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A dragon?</b></font>

114
00:07:19,810 --> 00:07:21,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's been a minute.</b></font>

115
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:23,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] That's no dragon.</b></font>

116
00:07:23,110 --> 00:07:25,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I would wager that pest
has more in common</b></font>

117
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:27,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with an ordinary lizard.</b></font>

118
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:28,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Guess we'll find out.</b></font>

119
00:07:30,080 --> 00:07:32,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] It looks so agitated.</b></font>

120
00:07:32,540 --> 00:07:34,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Wouldn't you be agitated</b></font>

121
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:36,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if a trio of fools
invaded your home?</b></font>

122
00:07:36,790 --> 00:07:38,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If we fail to sever
all three heads</b></font>

123
00:07:38,830 --> 00:07:40,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>at the exact same time,
they'll regenerate.</b></font>

124
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:43,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You've gotta be kidding!</b></font>

125
00:07:43,460 --> 00:07:44,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark gasps]</b></font>

126
00:07:50,850 --> 00:07:52,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[roaring]</b></font>

127
00:07:54,810 --> 00:07:56,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[FRIEREN] You run, Stark.
-[exclaims]</b></font>

128
00:07:56,850 --> 00:07:59,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've devised a genius plan.</b></font>

129
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:00,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What kind of plan starts...
[gasps]</b></font>

130
00:08:00,900 --> 00:08:02,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[growling]</b></font>

131
00:08:05,650 --> 00:08:07,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark screaming]</b></font>

132
00:08:08,410 --> 00:08:09,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark panting]</b></font>

133
00:08:17,210 --> 00:08:19,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You and I split up
to the left and right,</b></font>

134
00:08:19,670 --> 00:08:20,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>giving us each a head.</b></font>

135
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:21,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Got it.</b></font>

136
00:08:22,210 --> 00:08:24,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I would prefer to get this right
on our first try.</b></font>

137
00:08:24,710 --> 00:08:25,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Hm.</b></font>

138
00:08:25,880 --> 00:08:27,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If our timing is off,
it'll regenerate,</b></font>

139
00:08:27,670 --> 00:08:29,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and our work will be undone.</b></font>

140
00:08:29,470 --> 00:08:30,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So...</b></font>

141
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:34,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The genius plan
that you mentioned before...</b></font>

142
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We strike the beast
while it's busy playing</b></font>

143
00:08:36,930 --> 00:08:39,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with our dear companion, Stark.</b></font>

144
00:08:41,860 --> 00:08:45,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Stark screaming]
-[FERN] You mean...</b></font>

145
00:08:51,530 --> 00:08:54,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK]
You used me as live bait.</b></font>

146
00:08:57,250 --> 00:08:59,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That, I did. Good work, you two.</b></font>

147
00:09:04,380 --> 00:09:06,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

148
00:09:37,410 --> 00:09:38,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark sighs]</b></font>

149
00:09:38,790 --> 00:09:41,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Fern pants]
-[Stark grunts]</b></font>

150
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At least we made it here alive.</b></font>

151
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:45,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Perhaps, but just barely.</b></font>

152
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:48,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>See? I tried to tell you
it would be better</b></font>

153
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:50,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to journey to the next town.</b></font>

154
00:09:51,300 --> 00:09:54,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There lies the hidden
hot spring of legend.</b></font>

155
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:09,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's so shallow.</b></font>

156
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:12,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] This is just a footbath.</b></font>

157
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:14,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Don't say
I didn't warn you.</b></font>

158
00:10:16,070 --> 00:10:17,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] A footbath is fine.</b></font>

159
00:10:21,250 --> 00:10:23,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This way, we can
enjoy it together.</b></font>

160
00:10:25,210 --> 00:10:27,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both chuckle softly]</b></font>

161
00:10:29,250 --> 00:10:30,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] That's true.</b></font>

162
00:10:41,350 --> 00:10:43,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My, what a nice view.</b></font>

163
00:10:43,890 --> 00:10:45,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

164
00:10:45,980 --> 00:10:47,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now that we've made it up here,</b></font>

165
00:10:47,980 --> 00:10:50,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>why were you so eager
to come in the first place?</b></font>

166
00:10:51,150 --> 00:10:53,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>'Cause my master told me
about this spot.</b></font>

167
00:10:53,570 --> 00:10:56,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN] The famed hidden spring
of the Etwas Mountains</b></font>

168
00:10:56,570 --> 00:10:58,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>was a mere footbath.</b></font>

169
00:10:58,200 --> 00:11:01,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We wasted a painful amount
of time getting there.</b></font>

170
00:11:01,620 --> 00:11:04,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It was
a truly ridiculous adventure.</b></font>

171
00:11:04,330 --> 00:11:05,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

172
00:11:05,750 --> 00:11:08,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN] As useless
as many of them were,</b></font>

173
00:11:08,630 --> 00:11:12,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>those ridiculous adventures
are the ones I reflect on most.</b></font>

174
00:11:12,550 --> 00:11:15,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wouldn't trade the memories of
those moments with my friends</b></font>

175
00:11:15,590 --> 00:11:17,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for anything.</b></font>

176
00:11:21,060 --> 00:11:23,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I will never forget
that view.</b></font>

177
00:11:23,890 --> 00:11:24,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

178
00:11:30,650 --> 00:11:33,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] So you knew
there was no real hot spring.</b></font>

179
00:11:34,490 --> 00:11:37,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] I think I wanted to see
the same view my master saw.</b></font>

180
00:11:37,700 --> 00:11:39,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

181
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:47,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK]
I'll never forget it, either.</b></font>

182
00:12:00,430 --> 00:12:02,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern grunts, thuds]</b></font>

183
00:12:02,060 --> 00:12:03,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark screams]</b></font>

184
00:12:04,770 --> 00:12:06,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[thudding]
-[Stark grunts]</b></font>

185
00:12:07,060 --> 00:12:09,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark groans]</b></font>

186
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:13,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The way back is worse
than the way here.</b></font>

187
00:12:13,570 --> 00:12:15,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark groans]</b></font>

188
00:12:17,530 --> 00:12:19,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] I hope the memory
turns out sweeter</b></font>

189
00:12:20,030 --> 00:12:21,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>than the actual moment.</b></font>

190
00:12:22,910 --> 00:12:25,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>29 YEARS AFTER THE DEATH
OF HIMMEL THE HERO,</b></font>

191
00:12:25,410 --> 00:12:27,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>IN THE FORTRESS CITY OF HEIß,
LOCATED IN THE NORTHERN LANDS</b></font>

192
00:12:27,910 --> 00:12:29,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

193
00:12:29,170 --> 00:12:31,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren sighs]</b></font>

194
00:12:35,380 --> 00:12:37,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WOMAN]
You sure love hot springs</b></font>

195
00:12:37,300 --> 00:12:39,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for someone so young.</b></font>

196
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:48,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter, laughter]</b></font>

197
00:12:48,180 --> 00:12:49,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

198
00:12:50,980 --> 00:12:52,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[boy 1 grunts]</b></font>

199
00:12:52,110 --> 00:12:53,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[BOY 1, BOY 2] Yay!
-[BOY 3] Dang it!</b></font>

200
00:12:53,690 --> 00:12:55,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want a rematch!</b></font>

201
00:12:58,950 --> 00:13:01,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Mistress Frieren
is going to boil herself.</b></font>

202
00:13:01,700 --> 00:13:04,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's hardly left the hot spring
since we arrived.</b></font>

203
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:07,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And when she does come out,
it's only to visit magic shops.</b></font>

204
00:13:08,460 --> 00:13:11,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She says we're staying
for two more days.</b></font>

205
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:14,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, that's a short stay
if we go by her timeline.</b></font>

206
00:13:14,590 --> 00:13:16,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I made sure to give her
an earful.</b></font>

207
00:13:17,460 --> 00:13:19,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though, tomorrow,
we'll both be stuck here</b></font>

208
00:13:19,420 --> 00:13:20,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without any plans.</b></font>

209
00:13:20,760 --> 00:13:22,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No plans, huh?</b></font>

210
00:13:22,260 --> 00:13:24,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Could be a good chance
to hit an armorer.</b></font>

211
00:13:24,720 --> 00:13:26,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Need to get my axe sharpened.</b></font>

212
00:13:26,310 --> 00:13:27,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As I said,</b></font>

213
00:13:27,430 --> 00:13:29,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll be stuck with no plans.</b></font>

214
00:13:31,350 --> 00:13:32,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hm?</b></font>

215
00:13:33,770 --> 00:13:35,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Give me attention.</b></font>

216
00:13:38,650 --> 00:13:42,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It wouldn't kill you to be
more considerate, Mr. Stark.</b></font>

217
00:13:42,530 --> 00:13:44,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come on, you could've
just asked nicely.</b></font>

218
00:13:44,950 --> 00:13:47,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I mean, it's not like
I'm a mind reader.</b></font>

219
00:13:48,290 --> 00:13:50,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's always so hard on me.</b></font>

220
00:13:51,250 --> 00:13:52,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So be it.</b></font>

221
00:13:52,830 --> 00:13:54,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's time to get some payback.</b></font>

222
00:13:56,380 --> 00:13:58,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you're so desperate
for my attention,</b></font>

223
00:13:58,510 --> 00:13:59,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>how about you and I
go on a date?</b></font>

224
00:14:06,550 --> 00:14:07,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Oops.</b></font>

225
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:09,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, I'm dead.</b></font>

226
00:14:10,020 --> 00:14:12,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark groaning]</b></font>

227
00:14:13,520 --> 00:14:15,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] So long, cruel world.</b></font>

228
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark gasps]</b></font>

229
00:14:18,900 --> 00:14:20,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Very well.</b></font>

230
00:14:20,150 --> 00:14:22,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>See you tomorrow.</b></font>

231
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:37,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Your book.</b></font>

232
00:14:38,550 --> 00:14:39,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh.</b></font>

233
00:14:43,840 --> 00:14:45,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Women are a mystery.</b></font>

234
00:14:46,220 --> 00:14:48,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps]</b></font>

235
00:14:51,810 --> 00:14:53,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Mm.</b></font>

236
00:14:53,100 --> 00:14:54,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mm?</b></font>

237
00:14:57,900 --> 00:14:59,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hello?</b></font>

238
00:15:00,820 --> 00:15:02,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark sighs]</b></font>

239
00:15:09,370 --> 00:15:10,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark exclaims]</b></font>

240
00:15:13,370 --> 00:15:16,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Frieren...</b></font>

241
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:19,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, what do you think?</b></font>

242
00:15:19,880 --> 00:15:22,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is she plotting my murder
right now?</b></font>

243
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:25,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Am I dead meat or what?</b></font>

244
00:15:25,430 --> 00:15:26,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It sounds bleak.</b></font>

245
00:15:26,930 --> 00:15:29,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Bleaker still is the fact
you've come to me for advice.</b></font>

246
00:15:29,930 --> 00:15:31,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You've gone mad.</b></font>

247
00:15:31,640 --> 00:15:32,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] You're right.</b></font>

248
00:15:33,020 --> 00:15:35,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry for asking the impossible.</b></font>

249
00:15:35,100 --> 00:15:37,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Who said anything
about impossible?</b></font>

250
00:15:37,650 --> 00:15:39,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm a mature lady.</b></font>

251
00:15:39,610 --> 00:15:42,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know exactly how girls think.</b></font>

252
00:15:42,480 --> 00:15:43,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] You mean it?</b></font>

253
00:15:43,980 --> 00:15:45,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then I'm trusting you.</b></font>

254
00:15:46,280 --> 00:15:48,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need you to be honest with me.</b></font>

255
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:50,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Frieren, pretend I asked you.</b></font>

256
00:15:50,990 --> 00:15:52,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you happy or murderous?</b></font>

257
00:15:53,160 --> 00:15:56,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, you've grown up
into a fine man, Stark.</b></font>

258
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:58,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm so happy, I might treat you
to a nice meal.</b></font>

259
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:01,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Yeah, this isn't
helping at all.</b></font>

260
00:16:01,340 --> 00:16:03,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It feels like I'm a kid
being forced to hang out</b></font>

261
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:05,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-with his grandma.
-[Frieren grunts]</b></font>

262
00:16:05,760 --> 00:16:07,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You just called me a grandma.</b></font>

263
00:16:07,590 --> 00:16:09,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's offense two
after the hag slip.</b></font>

264
00:16:09,970 --> 00:16:11,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I draw the line at three.</b></font>

265
00:16:11,260 --> 00:16:13,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] You're counting?
Cut me some slack!</b></font>

266
00:16:13,220 --> 00:16:16,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What exactly is gonna happen
when you "draw the line?"</b></font>

267
00:16:16,390 --> 00:16:18,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll scream and cry.</b></font>

268
00:16:18,140 --> 00:16:21,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My tantrums have struck fear
into the hearts of many.</b></font>

269
00:16:21,270 --> 00:16:24,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They even caused Himmel the Hero
to tremble with terror.</b></font>

270
00:16:24,980 --> 00:16:27,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren crying]</b></font>

271
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[continues crying]</b></font>

272
00:16:34,030 --> 00:16:36,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[continues crying]</b></font>

273
00:16:41,670 --> 00:16:44,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN] She's been at it
for three days and three nights.</b></font>

274
00:16:44,500 --> 00:16:46,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-My!
-Save us.</b></font>

275
00:16:46,510 --> 00:16:48,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] That sounds awful.</b></font>

276
00:16:48,680 --> 00:16:50,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What happened
to being a mature lady?</b></font>

277
00:16:50,930 --> 00:16:52,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren wailing]</b></font>

278
00:16:53,810 --> 00:16:55,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren sighs] A-ha!</b></font>

279
00:16:56,100 --> 00:16:59,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your problem is you lack
all tact and sensitivity.</b></font>

280
00:16:59,190 --> 00:17:00,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark sighs]</b></font>

281
00:17:01,270 --> 00:17:04,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] So, are you going
on this date or not?</b></font>

282
00:17:05,270 --> 00:17:06,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd take it back,</b></font>

283
00:17:06,650 --> 00:17:09,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I think that would
only make things worse now.</b></font>

284
00:17:09,200 --> 00:17:10,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's fine.</b></font>

285
00:17:10,280 --> 00:17:11,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just need your help
to figure out</b></font>

286
00:17:11,910 --> 00:17:13,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>some places she would like.</b></font>

287
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:16,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I shouldn't have asked, huh?</b></font>

288
00:17:16,830 --> 00:17:17,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Forget I said any--</b></font>

289
00:17:17,830 --> 00:17:19,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Shall we take a look around?</b></font>

290
00:17:19,290 --> 00:17:20,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Huh?</b></font>

291
00:17:20,410 --> 00:17:22,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Surely
I can find somewhere.</b></font>

292
00:17:23,250 --> 00:17:24,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Somewhere she'd like.</b></font>

293
00:17:25,670 --> 00:17:28,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-So, what should we do now?
-I could go for a snack.</b></font>

294
00:17:28,300 --> 00:17:29,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WOMAN 1] Me too!</b></font>

295
00:17:29,470 --> 00:17:31,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You should start your date
at the market</b></font>

296
00:17:31,050 --> 00:17:32,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and buy her
something fun to eat.</b></font>

297
00:17:32,760 --> 00:17:35,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's at her crankiest
when she's hungry.</b></font>

298
00:17:37,100 --> 00:17:39,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The food stalls
could be a big hit.</b></font>

299
00:17:39,310 --> 00:17:40,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fern has loved snacking</b></font>

300
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:42,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>ever since she was
a little girl.</b></font>

301
00:17:42,690 --> 00:17:44,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

302
00:17:46,320 --> 00:17:48,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] I would select a route
that includes shops</b></font>

303
00:17:48,780 --> 00:17:50,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with pretty items like these.</b></font>

304
00:17:51,490 --> 00:17:54,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fern always likes baked goods,</b></font>

305
00:17:54,070 --> 00:17:56,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but her cravings fluctuate
with her mood.</b></font>

306
00:17:57,620 --> 00:17:59,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you want to play it safe,</b></font>

307
00:17:59,040 --> 00:18:01,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>have a few dessert options
in your back pocket.</b></font>

308
00:18:03,620 --> 00:18:05,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[BOTH] Mmm.</b></font>

309
00:18:05,130 --> 00:18:06,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

310
00:18:07,460 --> 00:18:09,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What else is there?</b></font>

311
00:18:15,850 --> 00:18:18,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] A quiet plaza
like this would be nice.</b></font>

312
00:18:18,890 --> 00:18:21,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think she would
appreciate the view.</b></font>

313
00:18:22,140 --> 00:18:23,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you, Frieren.</b></font>

314
00:18:23,690 --> 00:18:26,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know Fern even better
than I thought you did.</b></font>

315
00:18:26,150 --> 00:18:27,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm seriously impressed by you.</b></font>

316
00:18:28,020 --> 00:18:30,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, I don't know anything.</b></font>

317
00:18:30,650 --> 00:18:31,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hm?</b></font>

318
00:18:32,280 --> 00:18:34,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Don't be impressed by me,</b></font>

319
00:18:34,320 --> 00:18:36,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for Heiter
was the impressive one.</b></font>

320
00:18:36,910 --> 00:18:37,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hm?</b></font>

321
00:18:37,910 --> 00:18:40,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He studied little Fern
for years.</b></font>

322
00:18:40,330 --> 00:18:43,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm merely the keeper
of his detailed record.</b></font>

323
00:18:44,040 --> 00:18:46,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"She gets cranky
when she's hungry."</b></font>

324
00:18:46,670 --> 00:18:49,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"Her appetite
is bigger than she is."</b></font>

325
00:18:49,210 --> 00:18:50,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"She has an eye for beauty."</b></font>

326
00:18:51,710 --> 00:18:54,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"Her preferences change
with her mood."</b></font>

327
00:18:54,630 --> 00:18:57,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Everything I taught you
comes straight from Heiter.</b></font>

328
00:18:59,510 --> 00:19:01,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He had lofty hopes for me.</b></font>

329
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:03,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It was evident
he wanted me to take up</b></font>

330
00:19:03,600 --> 00:19:05,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the parental mantle
in his absence.</b></font>

331
00:19:06,230 --> 00:19:08,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Some parent I became.</b></font>

332
00:19:08,190 --> 00:19:09,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know what he saw her like,</b></font>

333
00:19:09,730 --> 00:19:11,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but I can't come up
with anything new.</b></font>

334
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:14,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

335
00:19:19,280 --> 00:19:20,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So what?</b></font>

336
00:19:20,450 --> 00:19:23,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You remember every tiny detail
he gave you.</b></font>

337
00:19:23,660 --> 00:19:24,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For what it's worth,</b></font>

338
00:19:24,790 --> 00:19:26,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think you're
a great parent to her.</b></font>

339
00:19:30,250 --> 00:19:32,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know,
this place feels familiar.</b></font>

340
00:19:32,670 --> 00:19:35,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Reminds me of where we first
celebrated Fern's birthday</b></font>

341
00:19:35,840 --> 00:19:38,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>back when it was
just the two of us.</b></font>

342
00:19:39,010 --> 00:19:40,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

343
00:19:42,100 --> 00:19:45,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] I suppose you can be
rather thoughtful, Stark.</b></font>

344
00:19:45,230 --> 00:19:46,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark chuckles] About time.</b></font>

345
00:19:48,310 --> 00:19:49,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] I'll strike...</b></font>

346
00:19:49,940 --> 00:19:52,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>one offense from the record.</b></font>

347
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:54,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Gee, thanks.</b></font>

348
00:20:02,240 --> 00:20:03,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps]</b></font>

349
00:20:19,220 --> 00:20:21,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need some advice.</b></font>

350
00:20:21,600 --> 00:20:24,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A boy asked me out on a date.</b></font>

351
00:20:24,220 --> 00:20:26,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What should I do?</b></font>

352
00:20:27,020 --> 00:20:28,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You've both gone mad.</b></font>

353
00:20:28,640 --> 00:20:29,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Hm?</b></font>

354
00:20:30,020 --> 00:20:32,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, on with your concerns.</b></font>

355
00:20:33,650 --> 00:20:35,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was wondering,</b></font>

356
00:20:35,190 --> 00:20:37,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>have you ever been
on a date before?</b></font>

357
00:20:37,320 --> 00:20:38,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have.</b></font>

358
00:20:38,530 --> 00:20:39,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>'Course not.</b></font>

359
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:43,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh? Have you really?</b></font>

360
00:20:43,780 --> 00:20:44,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes.</b></font>

361
00:20:44,830 --> 00:20:45,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

362
00:20:46,750 --> 00:20:48,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern sighs]</b></font>

363
00:20:48,250 --> 00:20:49,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who was it with?</b></font>

364
00:20:49,500 --> 00:20:51,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And what exactly did you do?</b></font>

365
00:20:52,130 --> 00:20:54,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Himmel and I tore apart
a whole village</b></font>

366
00:20:54,290 --> 00:20:55,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>looking for a lost cat.</b></font>

367
00:20:55,840 --> 00:20:58,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We got the job from the owner
of the magic shop.</b></font>

368
00:20:59,930 --> 00:21:03,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That just sounds like
business as usual to me.</b></font>

369
00:21:03,220 --> 00:21:04,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry, but...</b></font>

370
00:21:04,970 --> 00:21:07,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not sure that was a date.</b></font>

371
00:21:10,770 --> 00:21:12,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Listen, Fern,</b></font>

372
00:21:12,400 --> 00:21:14,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when close friends
of opposing sex</b></font>

373
00:21:14,480 --> 00:21:15,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>go out with just each other,</b></font>

374
00:21:15,980 --> 00:21:18,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that is what
we grownups call a date.</b></font>

375
00:21:19,700 --> 00:21:21,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Mmm...</b></font>

376
00:21:21,070 --> 00:21:23,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right? That's what
my master said.</b></font>

377
00:21:26,280 --> 00:21:29,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>By that logic,
then I dated Sein, as well.</b></font>

378
00:21:29,540 --> 00:21:31,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just forget it.</b></font>

379
00:21:33,170 --> 00:21:34,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Hm?</b></font>

380
00:21:34,330 --> 00:21:35,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[soft rustling]</b></font>

381
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:37,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Good night.</b></font>

382
00:21:43,970 --> 00:21:45,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren snores]</b></font>

383
00:21:58,280 --> 00:21:59,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

384
00:22:19,960 --> 00:22:22,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

385
00:23:50,010 --> 00:23:51,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MALE GUARD]
Fern, the first-class mage.</b></font>

386
00:23:51,810 --> 00:23:53,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Right this way, Miss.
-[overlapping chatter]</b></font>

387
00:23:53,770 --> 00:23:55,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HEITER] I was certain
we were going to die.</b></font>

388
00:23:55,390 --> 00:23:57,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Don't let
your guard down.</b></font>

389
00:23:57,310 --> 00:23:58,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL] I want to protect
other people's homes, too.</b></font>

390
00:23:58,850 --> 00:23:59,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>EPISODE 32:
OTHER PEOPLE'S HOMES</b></font>

